asgard-pim (1.0.0) thor; urgency=low

  * Initial @DISTRIBUTION@ personal information management metapackage.
    Adds Evolution + evolution-plugins on top of the GNOME PIM apps
    already in asgard-gnome-desktop (calendar, contacts, clocks).
    Depends on asgard-gnome-desktop so selecting this subcategory
    pulls the GNOME base set automatically.

